## The thirty-second version

```bash
# 1. Generate a 3-year synthetic SW Tehran District 18 corridor + GeoJSON and audit it
zemin demo --out-csv tehran_d18_insar.csv --out-geojson tehran_d18_corridor.geojson

# 2. Audit any MintPy, LiCSAR, or TAMAB piezometer CSV inside a project polygon + Persian dossier via Ollama
zemin audit examples/tehran_d18_insar.csv \
  --polygon examples/tehran_d18_corridor.geojson \
  --json-out d18_audit.json \
  --dossier fa --model gemma3:12b

# 3. Compare two survey periods longitudinally
zemin diff examples/tehran_d18_insar.csv examples/tehran_control_stable.csv \
  --polygon examples/tehran_d18_corridor.geojson
```

---

## Seven dynamical & geotechnical hazards detected

| Code | What it measures |
|---|---|
| `SUBSIDENCE_VELOCITY_HAZARD` | Vertical subsidence velocity (mm/yr), auto-projecting Sentinel-1 LOS via `d_v = d_LOS / cos(theta)` |
| `SUBSIDENCE_ACCELERATION` | Seasonally adjusted quadratic downward curvature (mm/yr^2) with t-statistic significance gating |
| `AQUIFER_REBOUND_FAILURE` | Collapse of wet-season elastic uplift & seasonal harmonic decay (irreversible clay compaction) |
| `CRITICAL_SLOWING_DOWN` | Rolling Ornstein-Uhlenbeck AR(1) recovery-rate decline (Marriott-Pope bias corrected) + rising variance |
| `DIFFERENTIAL_SETTLEMENT_TILT` | Pairwise Haversine angular distortion `|dS| / L` against Eurocode-7 limits (`1/500` cracking, `1/250` distress) |
| `GROUNDWATER_COMPACTION_COUPLING` | Piezometer head drop (m/yr) and GRACE TWS loss (cm/yr) coupled to skeletal compaction ratio (mm/m) |
| `INSAR_DATA_INTEGRITY` | Pre-sign-off quality audit for low temporal coherence and Sentinel-1 C-band phase-unwrapping jumps (~28 mm) |

---

## Built-in zero-dependency adapters

| Adapter | Data Source | Handles |
|---|---|---|
| `mintpy` | MintPy / ASF HyP3 / ARIA PS-InSAR | Both wide (`D20240101...`) and long formats, meters-to-mm scaling, LOS-to-vertical projection |
| `licsar` | COMET-LiCSAR / LiCSBAS | Frame cumulative displacement exports and average coherence |
| `piezometer` | Iran TAMAB / ABFA wells & GRACE/ERA5 | Depth-to-water, extensometer settlement, Persian/Arabic digits (`۰۱۲۳۴۵۶۷۸۹`) |
| `generic` | Standard `.csv` and `.jsonl` | Clean multi-site geospatial time series |

GeoJSON `Polygon` and `MultiPolygon` spatial filtering is built into
`zemin.geo` using pure-Python ray-casting and Haversine geometry—zero native
GDAL/GEOS compilation issues.

---

## Offline RTL Persian dashboards

```bash
# FastAPI + built-in RTL Persian dashboard (http://127.0.0.1:8000)
pip install "zemin[web]"
zemin serve --port 8000

# Or RTL Persian Streamlit dashboard
pip install "zemin[streamlit]"
streamlit run src/zemin/streamlit_app.py
```

